Third-party assets

The MIT licence above covers the source code. It does not cover the following
files, which are included under their own terms and are not the copyright of
the author:

  static/images/pnp.jpeg          Philippine National Police seal and
                                  headquarters photograph, from the PNP
                                  Facebook page. Used for identification only;
                                  this project is not endorsed by or
                                  affiliated with the PNP.
  angeles_city_barangays.geojson  Philippine administrative boundaries,
                                  published as open data.
  data/angeles_city_other_info.csv
                                  Population and land area figures from the
                                  Philippine Statistics Authority census.
